  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Natural rubber is poly isoprene containing Cis stereo-chemistry alkene units. <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Nylon- <math><mn>6</mn></math> has amide linkage, i.e., <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/f746db1c-a695-4679-9e93-9bbbf14189f0-image47.png\"/>. <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Cellulose is a straight chain polysaccharide composed of <math><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></math> Glucose units held together by <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> glycosidic linkage <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/c9ff7abc-9597-41b9-a444-e99f03f8e1e5-image48.png\"/>",
